                                                "sense_id": "422c617c-a4ad-3029-8a4d-56dbc5cab2d5",
                                                "text": "I was 100% raw from 2014 until early 2018."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e83c52f2-b36c-3b20-b280-af468e483b44",
                                        "entry_id": "22198d99-85af-31b3-90d3-bb70e9467fe3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not treated or processed; in a natural state, unrefined, unprocessed. (of materials, products, etc.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ead9640d-39c2-4ec4-ba9e-8ce52e655f08",
                                                "sense_id": "e83c52f2-b36c-3b20-b280-af468e483b44",
                                                "text": "Volatiles of kecap manis and its raw materials were extracted using Likens-Nickerson apparatus with diethyl ether as the extraction solvent. The extracts were then dried with anhydrous sodium sulfate, concentrated using a rotary evaporator followed by flushing using nitrogen until the volume was about 0.5 ml."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2dd1f231-c48b-4eea-ab6d-4fd54a2da1ba",
